{
  "title": "Security Group · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "ENI 등 리소스에 적용하는 상태 저장 허용 방화벽이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Security Group</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#inbound-rules\">Inbound Rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#outbound-rules\">Outbound Rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#stateful-connection-tracking\">Stateful Connection Tracking</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#security-group-referencing\">Security Group Referencing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#default-security-group\">Default Security Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#vpc-association-and-exceptions\">VPC Association and Exceptions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>48 / 62</span></div><h1>Security Group</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Security Group은 연결된 리소스의 네트워크 트래픽을 허용하는 Stateful 정책이다. Inbound와 Outbound 규칙을 각각 정의하고 허용된 연결의 응답은 연결 상태를 기준으로 처리한다.</p><p>여러 Security Group을 붙이면 허용 규칙이 합쳐진다. 규칙에 명시적 Deny를 넣는 방식은 지원하지 않으므로 강제 차단이 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a> 등 다른 경계를 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Stateful Connection 추적\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Stateful Connection 추적</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>New inbound connection</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client → TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> 443</strong><small>Inbound Rule 확인</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Security Group</strong><small>허용된 새 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>요청 처리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Response</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> response</strong><small>같은 연결의 응답</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Connection tracking</strong><small>Stateful 처리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client</strong><small>별도 반대방향 Allow 불필요</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">응답 Traffic과 Instance가 새로 시작하는 Outbound Connection을 구분한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"inbound-rules\"><h2>Inbound Rules<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#inbound-rules\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>프로토콜·Port·Source를 정해 리소스로 들어오는 연결을 허용한다. Web <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 Source를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> Security Group으로 지정하면 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 계층에서 오는 트래픽만 허용하는 설계가 가능하다. 인터넷 전체 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 허용할 때 노출 범위를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"outbound-rules\"><h2>Outbound Rules<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#outbound-rules\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>프로토콜·Port·Destination으로 리소스가 시작하는 외부 연결을 제한한다. 새 Security Group의 기본 Outbound 허용과 사용자 규칙을 구분한다. Outbound를 제한하면 패키지 업데이트나 외부 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>도 영향을 받을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"stateful-connection-tracking\"><h2>Stateful Connection Tracking<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#stateful-connection-tracking\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>허용한 Inbound 요청에 대한 응답과 허용한 Outbound 요청의 응답은 반대 방향의 별도 규칙 없이 통과한다. 이것이 Stateless <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>과 핵심 차이다. 기존 연결의 상태 추적 특성 때문에 규칙 변경 효과를 연결 단위로 이해한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"security-group-referencing\"><h2>Security Group Referencing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#security-group-referencing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Address 대신 다른 Security Group을 Source·Destination에 지정할 수 있다. 참조는 그 Group의 규칙을 복제하는 것이 아니라 연결된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>의 트래픽 대상을 식별하는 방식이다. Peering·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>의 참조 지원 범위도 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"default-security-group\"><h2>Default Security Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#default-security-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기본 Group은 자체 Group에서 오는 Inbound와 기본 Outbound 등 초기 규칙을 가진다. Custom Group의 Inbound 기본 상태와 다르다. 기본 Group을 무조건 안전한 최소 권한 구성이라고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"vpc-association-and-exceptions\"><h2>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Association and Exceptions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#vpc-association-and-exceptions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>현재 Security Group <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> Association으로 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 추가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>에 연결할 수 있는 기능이 있다. 또한 Amazon <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>나 Instance Metadata 등 Group이 필터하지 않는 트래픽도 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 제어에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#health-checks-and-resolver\">Route 53 Resolver</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Firewall 같은 수단을 별도로 검토한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>의 Group은 443을 사용자에게 허용하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 Group은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> Group에서 오는 앱 Port만 허용한다. DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Group은 앱 Group에서 오는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Port만 허용한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>명시적 거부 규칙은 없으며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>과 적용 위치가 다르다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-security-groups.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-security-groups.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q012\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q013\" data-question=\"Q013\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q013</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q013/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A security group allows inbound TCP port 443. Must a separate outbound rule allow response packets for that connection?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q013\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. Security groups are stateful, so responses to allowed traffic are permitted</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q013\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. A network ACL automatically modifies the security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q013\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, but only when a NAT gateway exists</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q013\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, always</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 상태 저장이다. 다만 별도의 새 아웃바운드 연결은 아웃바운드 규칙을 따진다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q014\" data-question=\"Q014\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q014</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to explicitly deny traffic from a source IP range across an entire subnet. Which control should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q014\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI attribute</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a> 수준에서 명시적 거부를 지원하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 허용 규칙만 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q070\" data-question=\"Q070\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q070</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q070/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to evaluate whether security group configurations remain compliant and track configuration changes. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q070\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Config</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>는 리소스 구성 기록과 규정 준수 평가를 돕는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">이전 용어 <b>Secrets Manager</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">다음 용어 <b>Snowball Edge</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
